WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Edge of the Whispering Nebula, Mysterious longing, cautious anticipation.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.300 align:center
Lyra: The Whispering Nebula. It... calls to me. A song I've almost forgotten.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.600 align:center
Kael: It's beautiful. And dangerous. The currents here are unpredictable.

4
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.900 align:center
Lyra: But the stories say... truth resides within its heart. A truth I need.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.200 align:center
Kael: A heavy truth, perhaps. Like all things worth finding.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Deep within the Whispering Nebula, Growing unease, overwhelming nostalgia, dawning suspicion.

7
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.800 align:center
Lyra: This shard... it hums. Like a dream just beyond reach.

8
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:42.100 align:center
Kael: Lyra, wait. The raw memories here can be overwhelming. They can consume you.

9
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:48.400 align:center
Lyra: No, this isn't just a memory. It feels like *mine*. A piece of a forgotten self.

10
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.700 align:center
Lyra: Loss... so much loss...

11
00:00:50.1000 --> 00:00:54.1000 align:center
Kael: Pull back! Now. You don't know what you're stirring.

12
00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:04.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A clearing within the nebula, near a dark vortex, Clear threat, growing suspicion, dread.

13
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.600 align:center
Lyra: This is the Silence's work. It leaves nothing behind.

14
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:12.900 align:center
Kael: It is. I've... seen its touch before. Closer than you know.

15
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:19.200 align:center
Lyra: Closer? What aren't you telling me, Kael? Your fear isn't just for me, is it?

16
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:24.500 align:center
Kael: My fear is for what we might awaken. For what *you* might awaken.

17
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:33.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The core chamber of the Whispering Nebula, Tense anticipation, sudden terror, overwhelming presence.

18
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:39.100 align:center
Lyra: There. The core shard. It pulses with a light I haven't seen since...

19
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.400 align:center
Kael: Something's stirring. The air... it's growing cold.

20
00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:45.700 align:center
Lyra: We're close. The answers are within reach.

21
00:01:45.1000 --> 00:01:51.1000 align:center
Kael: Not answers. A presence. It knows we're here. Lyra, we need to be ready.

22
00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:59.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Hero's mindscape / The core chamber, Profound grief, despair, vulnerability.

23
00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.600 align:center
Lyra: No... not this. The emptiness... the echo of a name I can't remember.

24
00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.900 align:center
Lyra: It's all gone. There's nothing left but dust.

25
00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.200 align:center
Lyra: Oblivion... peace...

26
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.500 align:center
Kael: Lyra! Fight it! Don't let it take you!

27
00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:19.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The core chamber, Desperate action, partial revelation, dawning suspicion.

28
00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.100 align:center
Kael: You will not have her!

29
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.400 align:center
Lyra: Kael... what was that?

30
00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.700 align:center
Kael: A... a trick. An old ward. It won't hold long.

31
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The core chamber, Silence temporarily repelled, Suspicion, distrust, forced calm.

32
00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:43.300 align:center
Lyra: An old ward? I've never seen anything like it. And that light... it wasn't just a trick.

33
00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.600 align:center
Lyra: Who are you, really, Kael?

34
00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:50.900 align:center
Kael: I am your companion. I am here to help you find your truth.

35
00:02:51.200 --> 00:03:05.200 align:center
Lyra: And what truth do you hide from me? What power have you kept secret? We came here for honesty, Kael. Don't tell me you're a part of the very thing we seek to understand.

36
00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:11.500 align:center
Kael: I swear to you, I am not. But my past... it complicates things. Profoundly.

37
00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:17.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The core chamber, Desperate resolve, lingering tension.

38
00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:24.100 align:center
Lyra: Complications or not, we are here. The answers are in that shard. We retrieve it. Now.

39
00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:29.400 align:center
Kael: Agreed. Whatever secrets it holds, we face them together. Before the Silence returns.

40
00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:35.700 align:center
Lyra: It will return. It always does. But not before we have what we came for.

41
00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:44.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A temporary shielded pocket within the nebula, Shock, despair, betrayal, shattering truth.

42
00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:53.300 align:center
Lyra: No... it can't be. The Silence... it's not a force. It's a wound. My wound. A consequence of my own forgotten grief.

43
00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.600 align:center
Lyra: And you... Kael... you knew.

44
00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:03.900 align:center
Kael: I did. I was there. I witnessed it all. I swore to protect you from this truth, to keep it buried.

45
00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:11.200 align:center
Lyra: You didn't protect me. You lied. You let me walk into this... this echo of my own destruction.

46
00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:20.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The nebula, under direct assault by the Silence, Overwhelming terror, cosmic destruction, desperate flight.

47
00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.800 align:center
Kael: It's reacting! The nebula... it's tearing itself apart!

48
00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:29.100 align:center
Lyra: My grief... it feeds it. The truth has only made it stronger.

49
00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:34.400 align:center
Kael: We have to go! Now! This place is collapsing. It's consuming everything!

50
00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.700 align:center
Lyra: Run? Where? It follows me. It *is* me.

51
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.000 align:center
Kael: We run to understand! To find a way to mend what was broken!

52
00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:52.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Drifting in the void, near the consumed nebula, Profound loss, despair, fractured bond, bleak uncertainty.

53
00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:59.600 align:center
Lyra: All that hope... gone. Replaced by a truth that devours worlds. And you... you knew the cost.

54
00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:06.900 align:center
Kael: I believed it was the only way. To spare you the burden. I was wrong. Terribly wrong.

55
00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:15.200 align:center
Lyra: How can I trust you? How can I trust myself, when my very existence is a catalyst for such destruction?

56
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:26.500 align:center
Kael: Trust is shattered. I know. But the journey isn't over. We carry this truth now. Both of us. And perhaps... that shared weight is the only path forward.

57
00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:29.800 align:center
Lyra: A path of ashes. And broken promises.
